    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Move <sprite name=Move>: lets you get around the map, each tile has a
    move cost that it takes to enter.

    Attack<sprite name=Attack>: lets you damage
    enemies, by default attacks have range 1.

    Block <sprite name=Block>: negates
    the next x damage you receive from attacks until the start of your next turn.

    Skill
    <sprite name=Skill>: allows you to perform abilities in the abilities panel in
    the top left of the screen. Each ability can only be used once a turn.

    Lockpick
    <sprite name=Lockpick>: allows you to open chests, one of the starting abilities.

    Apply
    conditions: apply conditions to target within range or gain condition.

    Summon:
    summons indicated in an adjacent safe space. Card exausts until summon is removed.'
